---
import { siteConfig } from "../config";
---
<dialog class="mini-dialog" id="mini-program-dialog" aria-labelledby="mini-program-title">
  <div class="dialog-inner">
    <h2 id="mini-program-title">在微信中开始测评</h2>
    <p>打开微信，在顶部搜索框输入下面的小程序名称，即可进入正式测评。</p>
    <div class="wechat-name">{siteConfig.miniProgramName}</div>
    <p>网站不会要求你在浏览器中填写孩子信息。测评和报告均在微信小程序内完成。</p>
    <div class="dialog-actions"><button class="button button-outline js-copy-name" type="button" data-name={siteConfig.miniProgramName}>复制名称</button><button class="button button-dark js-close-mini" type="button">关闭</button></div>
  </div>
</dialog>
<script>
  const dialog = document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>("#mini-program-dialog");
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>(".js-open-mini").forEach((button) => button.addEventListener("click", () => dialog?.showModal()));
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>(".js-close-mini").forEach((button) => button.addEventListener("click", () => dialog?.close()));
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>(".js-copy-name").forEach((button) => button.addEventListener("click", async () => {
    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(button.dataset.name || "看见学习力");
    button.textContent = "已复制";
  }));
</script>
